{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003990/extras/9f26f358f98dcfad2654835a132d85cf.poster.avif?t=1760444399\" width=500 height=281 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003990/extras/9f26f358f98dcfad2654835a132d85cf.webm?t=1760444399\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Summary</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story about the mystery of a boarding room inhabited by a supernatural being, where its caretaker is required to perform a mourning ritual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rocky, who has just returned from work, is asked by his grandfather to look after the boarding house. However, the haunted room forces Rocky to carry out the ritual on his own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ghost, known as \u201cThe Girl\u201d, wants to share something she has been keeping inside, and you are forced to follow her will for her own sake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is really happening? Who is the ghost? And why does it keep haunting the boarding house?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003990/extras/6153d578cbce4f243b1f71f3910fc4c7.poster.avif?t=1760444399\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003990/extras/6153d578cbce4f243b1f71f3910fc4c7.webm?t=1760444399\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003990/extras/6153d578cbce4f243b1f71f3910fc4c7.mp4?t=1760444399\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>&quot;Unravel the forbidden story hidden in puzzles and memories.&quot;</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features\u00a0</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >120+ minutes Playtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unique Puzzles &amp; Challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Rich</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive Dialogue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-save at each scene</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro Atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two Endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ending Guide (unlocked after one ending)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recommended to use stereo audio, such as a headset, since some puzzles require sound positioning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003990/extras/30ca03d7418287180555ff0b900f17e2.poster.avif?t=1760444399\" width=500 height=281 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003990/extras/30ca03d7418287180555ff0b900f17e2.webm?t=1760444399\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>&quot;A retro psychological horror that twists your sanity and choices.&quot;</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Walking the Fields","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4003990/3884f36724fb8bf4742e2022f81a24d07024439b.jpg"},{"name":"Scout Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4003990/56f89d74c23016592d94f7221eaed1175bdf58b7.jpg"},{"name":"Candle Seek","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4003990/947b738cc0907bfb6933f88a94a99b49b82872f0.jpg"},{"name":"Calm Yourself","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4003990/c13e63766ecc3b1bd13a8d33c7ed1f3d0a4abadc.jpg"},{"name":"Work for Nothing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4003990/decdc9ad4156ac07879b7eb639e4244dba48a126.jpg"},{"name":"Who are you?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4003990/6c2717e8709f1cb71c53dfc1be324bd5ca1ef48b.jpg"},{"name":"Take care on the road","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4003990/d7b973ae07f49ca142364cd4f9768b83b5bc5a5a.jpg"},{"name":"Yellow Notes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4003990/b4d09ccd08a847f46e3a72a99bcd7bf92283726d.jpg"},{"name":"Magic Sofa","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4003990/f83f2f114e826ba72635f00c9383f6429c63599f.jpg"},{"name":"That's Very Tricky","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4003990/e8dd941a13d73d5a72db756ae6f37f8a50fce139.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4003990?t=1760444399","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003990/3453adbd05127e3cb81fecb26972cc1fc0370cb7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760444399","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003990/d403cb749a4f9f04e20d675c606924bccd187bf5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760444399","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003990/d403cb749a4f9f04e20d675c606924bccd187bf5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760444399","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"T